<!--Post: 4112--><!--Time: 1105683964-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4112"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bodycheck<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bodycheck<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 13, 2005 - 10:26 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->2 days... <BR>VERY SIGNIFICANT ANNIVERSARY... <BR>Tom in Wichita... <BR> <BR>anyone have any thoughts as to whether we will see anything new? <BR> <BR>B <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4112-->
<!--Post: 4115--><!--Time: 1105689590-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4115"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 13, 2005 - 11:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Personally, I think something is going down.  Not sure what, but something will happen, even if down below the surface.  We may not know for a while if it does.  Just my gut. <BR> <BR>You&#39;re right about the timing.  Something&#39;s up.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4115-->
<!--Post: 4120--><!--Time: 1105699189-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4120"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Researcher<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Researcher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 14, 2005 - 2:39 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The 15th will come and go.  BTK will be silent.  Those who anticipate another drop will be disappointed.  That&#39;s my prediction.  Hope that I am wrong. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4120-->
<!--Post: 4121--><!--Time: 1105708672-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4121"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 14, 2005 - 5:17 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I go with Pax56&#39;s opinion, but carry it to an absurd degree. BTK acquires a copy of the <i>Eagle</i>, dated January 15. As he thoroughly knows Wichita, he places the item, wrapped in the paper, in an area where it will safely be hidden. Much later on the fifteenth, BTK communicates the locale of the secreted booty. Or he waits a few days, a few weeks. The significance is that the heat is on more than ever. It wouldn&#39;t surprise me if something hasn&#39;t already been hidden which BTK will reference on Jan 15. Again, too much heat. No, that won&#39;t happen that but something&#39;s in the air; I&#39;ll find it &#34;unamusing&#34; if BTK refuses to comply.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4121-->
<!--Post: 4143--><!--Time: 1105747399-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4143"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Woody<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Woody<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 14, 2005 - 4:03 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I agree w/ George.  I believe that BTK has already dropped/hidden something &amp; he will pass along info about it this weekend.  I wouldn&#39;t be surprised if he doesn&#39;t claim involvement w/ another unsolved homicide.   <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4143-->
<!--Post: 4154--><!--Time: 1105772899-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4154"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ozdude<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ozdude<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 14, 2005 - 11:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It appears to have came and went. People in Sedgwick County are bored with this case. Even the local media web sites don&#39;t acknowledge the anniversary. I wouldn&#39;t have remembered either if it weren&#39;t for this thread. People are beginning to care less and less, especially when you&#39;re without power for a week in 20 degree temps due to an ice storm. BT...who?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4154-->
<!--Post: 4177--><!--Time: 1105825119-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4177"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 15, 2005 - 1:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Came and went? Its still the 15th...don&#39;t quit so early, I doubt BTK will...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4177-->
<!--Post: 4178--><!--Time: 1105825338-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4178"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 15, 2005 - 1:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Came and went? Its still the 15th...don&#39;t quit so early, I doubt BTK will...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4178-->
<!--Post: 4182--><!--Time: 1105841327-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4182"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Woody<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Woody<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 15, 2005 - 6:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I agree w/ Weeza.  The day isn&#39;t over yet.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4182-->
<!--Post: 4255--><!--Time: 1105979097-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4255"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tbear<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tbear<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 17, 2005 - 8:24 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->he&#39;s dropping backwards. next will be shirley vian on 3/17.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4255-->
<!--Post: 4283--><!--Time: 1106023653-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4283"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ozdude<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ozdude<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 17, 2005 - 8:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I was working 3rd shift and my days were messed up..probably should have went under predictions anyway, but I was right..except the news had about a 30 second blurb. Trust me though people for the most part are bored and don&#39;t really even talk about it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4283-->
<!--Post: 10063--><!--Time: 1109738818-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10063"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ozdude<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ozdude<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 8:46 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->OK I&#39;ve done gone post crazy...gotta get it out of the system..weather is warming up and there will be no free time...I don&#39;t know how much anything on this web site did to help...nobody will probably ever know...but some have speculated...here&#39;s my speculation since I&#39;m an ego-centric sob...things were a little quiet, we had a horrible ice storm, the local news &#40;may have been the paper&#41; even said Dennis spent a week at his mother&#39;s as he had no power, I make my post on the 14th that nobody cares about BFD and bam he goes post card and package nuts, he was like a virtual Mail Boxes, ETC....PAY NO ATTENTION TO THAT MAN BEHIND THE CURTAIN.....<!--/Text--></td></tr>
